{"3459050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Acrolyte", "steam_appid": 3459050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acrolyte</strong> is a 2D action-adventure platformer which brings the player through vast, mysterious alien landscapes. Awaken from your dying slumber in an endless pursuit of revenge against ancient forces beyond your comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the iron fist of Humanity, the <strong>Tsumeta</strong> are subjugated and driven from their homeworld. Aboard an interstellar space station, you and your crew, like thousands of others, are sent into deep space. For decades, you have drifted toward a planet, forced to expand the reach and influence of Mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon arrival in orbit of <strong>Eyra-31B</strong>, your crew begins to survey and explore the decaying remnants of an uncontacted civilization. After the extraction of an anomalous artifact causes a system failure on your ship, a Human military vessel makes contact with your crew to investigate. Concluding this investigation, your crew is executed. In the ensuing chaos, the station's orbit is destabilized, causing it to crash into the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the darkness, a white star descends upon us, taking toll of the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not ready yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>360 Degree Free-Aim</strong>: Use the mouse or a controller to aim and fire in any direction, for fast paced precise combat<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459050/extras/18911ec8cb71c82f5aa72b09dbcbbbf8.poster.avif?t=1768255092\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459050/extras/18911ec8cb71c82f5aa72b09dbcbbbf8.webm?t=1768255092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459050/extras/18911ec8cb71c82f5aa72b09dbcbbbf8.mp4?t=1768255092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Movement Techniques:</strong> Slide, launch and fly through caverns of <strong>Eyra-31B</strong> with a series of intricate, chainable mobility upgrades. Some optional techniques are innate to the player, and can only be executed by skilled players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459050/extras/e8b068893501a02b01d7ac6f7b9fb883.poster.avif?t=1768255092\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459050/extras/e8b068893501a02b01d7ac6f7b9fb883.webm?t=1768255092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459050/extras/e8b068893501a02b01d7ac6f7b9fb883.mp4?t=1768255092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Ingame Logbook:</strong> Uncover the mysteries of<strong> Eyra-31B</strong> by cataloging your discoveries, equipment, and encounters with local wildlife in the logbook. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459050/extras/3c9a19b8d307a4575eb8f6fc8efd445c.poster.avif?t=1768255092\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459050/extras/3c9a19b8d307a4575eb8f6fc8efd445c.webm?t=1768255092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459050/extras/3c9a19b8d307a4575eb8f6fc8efd445c.mp4?t=1768255092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acrolyte</strong> is a 2D action-adventure platformer which brings the player through vast, mysterious alien landscapes. Awaken from your dying slumber in an endless pursuit of revenge against ancient forces beyond your comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the iron fist of Humanity, the <strong>Tsumeta</strong> are subjugated and driven from their homeworld. Aboard an interstellar space station, you and your crew, like thousands of others, are sent into deep space. For decades, you have drifted toward a planet, forced to expand the reach and influence of Mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon arrival in orbit of <strong>Eyra-31B</strong>, your crew begins to survey and explore the decaying remnants of an uncontacted civilization. After the extraction of an anomalous artifact causes a system failure on your ship, a Human military vessel makes contact with your crew to investigate. Concluding this investigation, your crew is executed. In the ensuing chaos, the station's orbit is destabilized, causing it to crash into the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the darkness, a white star descends upon us, taking toll of the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not ready yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>360 Degree Free-Aim</strong>: Use the mou